---
import { contact } from '../lib/portfolio';
const whatsapp = contact.whatsapp.replace(/\D/g,'');
---
<section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / LET’S TALK</p><h2>A good website starts <br/>with a conversation<span class="dot">.</span></h2><p>Tell me what you do, what you need and where you’d like to go. We can work out the next step together.</p><p class="contact-location">Based in Dubai. Working with people across the UAE.</p></div><div class="contact-options"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE EASIEST WAY TO REACH ME</span>{whatsapp ? <a class="button light" href={`https://wa.me/${whatsapp}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hi! I would like to discuss a website project.')}`}>Start a conversation on WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> : <><span class="button light unavailable">WhatsApp <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><p class="contact-note">Contact details coming soon.</p></>}</div><div class="email-option"><span>Prefer email?</span>{contact.email?<a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email} ↗</a>:<p class="contact-note">Email will be added here soon.</p>}</div><p class="contact-small">{!whatsapp&&!contact.email?'Enquiries are not connected yet.':''}</p></div></div></section>
